{"steam_appid":4279630,"steam_name":"Friendly Steps","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4279630/1153401065/98a6fe4c7c9eaac904bc0a8c5138b4d902a83e6b/1788216090/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1788897476","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257414225/c4d3ed645a1bfc5f1198e2a9d607609ad676c6dd/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1788897476","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4279630/56e19e10675fd844c9b2d39e8b47fd8a38ae1e34/ss_56e19e10675fd844c9b2d39e8b47fd8a38ae1e34.1920x1080.jpg?t=1788897746","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4279630/83743aba0ff7032fa924eda5b70135bf67fb8527/ss_83743aba0ff7032fa924eda5b70135bf67fb8527.1920x1080.jpg?t=1788897746","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4279630/b9e39f08a518ca1a289bf914215aab3e26a121bc/ss_b9e39f08a518ca1a289bf914215aab3e26a121bc.1920x1080.jpg?t=1788897746","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4279630/c5e1fd72f7a6b94405936272508c9e22c5dd27c3/ss_c5e1fd72f7a6b94405936272508c9e22c5dd27c3.1920x1080.jpg?t=1788897746","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4279630/bededa2e147ef0d7c0ca87f8f15d7b785b2191e0/ss_bededa2e147ef0d7c0ca87f8f15d7b785b2191e0.1920x1080.jpg?t=1788897746"],"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4279630/extras/f692c8ce7abd2ba95c54b77a4c3a6ed9.avif?t=1788897746\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4279630/extras_big/f692c8ce7abd2ba95c54b77a4c3a6ed9.webp?t=1788897746 width=1560 height=394 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4279630/extras/38777e439cc829d3b560ba4957f27320.poster.avif?t=1788897746\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4279630/extras/38777e439cc829d3b560ba4957f27320.webm?t=1788897746\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4279630/extras/38777e439cc829d3b560ba4957f27320.mp4?t=1788897746\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DRUNK-WALKING PHYSICS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Okay now, get yourself together and control your legs, one step at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sounds easy? Not really. You literally have to control each leg independently. Keep your balance, stumble forward, crawl if you must. Just try not to land face-first on the pavement!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4279630/extras/71e5b510b4845e0aa5b0e0f06e6f0689.poster.avif?t=1788897746\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4279630/extras/71e5b510b4845e0aa5b0e0f06e6f0689.webm?t=1788897746\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4279630/extras/71e5b510b4845e0aa5b0e0f06e6f0689.mp4?t=1788897746\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DRINK AS A TEAM, GET HOME AS A TEAM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rope sounded like a fun idea: chained together, like conquering a peak, right? It would be a shame if you fell off the bridge with this rope on and dragged the whole squad down with you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4279630/extras/ed873169712040a09d295adb820a01e7.poster.avif?t=1788897746\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4279630/extras/ed873169712040a09d295adb820a01e7.webm?t=1788897746\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4279630/extras/ed873169712040a09d295adb820a01e7.mp4?t=1788897746\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WHY IS THIS CITY SO HARD ON US?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I suggested calling an Uber, but you guys wanted to take a walk and take some side quests, huh?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now you're dealing with hills, stairs, bridges, parks, construction sites, playgrounds, and all kinds of sketchy “shortcuts” and suspicious bozos. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every street corner turns into a new physics challenge waiting to ruin your walk home. Good luck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4279630/extras/fa646ee17812981986266dfc69297e38.poster.avif?t=1788897746\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4279630/extras/fa646ee17812981986266dfc69297e38.webm?t=1788897746\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4279630/extras/fa646ee17812981986266dfc69297e38.mp4?t=1788897746\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WASTED AND FABULOUS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your look and stumble through the night in style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Salaryman, firefighter, punk, cop, or maybe a streamer? Pick your ridiculous look and hit the streets. Everyone deserves a little fun after hours!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Physics-based movement: control each leg independently<br>• Rope-linked co-op chaos (1-4 players)<br>• Various locations and challenging routes<br>• Hidden shortcuts, items, quests, and side paths<br>• Speedrun mode -  find the fastest way home<br>• Character customization and emotes<br>• Online voice chat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4279630/extras/d7b03a68dd65a05fdff33dea90322f8c.poster.avif?t=1788897746\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4279630/extras/d7b03a68dd65a05fdff33dea90322f8c.webm?t=1788897746\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4279630/extras/d7b03a68dd65a05fdff33dea90322f8c.mp4?t=1788897746\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>*Burp*</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maybe that last drink was a bad idea!</p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-4460 or AMD FX-8320 / Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 750 Ti / GTX 950 or AMD Radeon R7 260X / RX 550<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1.5 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> there is no audio gambling (yet)</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-4770K or AMD Ryzen 5 1500X / Ryzen 3 3200G<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1050 Ti / GTX 1650 or AMD Radeon RX 560 / RX 470<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1.5 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> the louder, the better<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> hm... vr drunk simulator... sounds like a good idea!</li></ul>","genres":["Adventure","Casual","Massively Multiplayer","RPG","Simulation"],"developers":["KORO.GAMES"],"publishers":["Ytopia"],"release_date":"3 Sep, 2026"}